# issue: 624
# red_on: 2026-09-15, pre-fix build at 379d8ed1 (the parent of #695's f0dcd2e6): step 7 `branch merge b into tgt` failed with `storage: LanceError(IO): … Not found: …/nodes/<dataset>/tree/a.<ULID>/_indices/<uuid>/page_lookup.lance`; steps 1-6 green, the first merge `fast_forward`; green at f0dcd2e6 (#695) itself.
# notes: the issue's exact order: a fast-forwards into the untouched tgt, then b
# notes: merges into tgt with no tgt write in between. The fast-forward switched
# notes: tgt's Person registration onto a's Lance branch; the merge's first-touch
# notes: fork of that table stamped the index inherited from main with a's base,
# notes: so the index file was looked up under a's tree. Every index kind seeded
# notes: on main (BTREE, full-text, vector, built-in id) is read on tgt afterwards.

--- runner
timeout_ms: 10000
environments:
  - target: omnigraph-engine
    storage: local-filesystem
  - target: omnigraph-engine-dst
    storage: in-memory-object-store
    seeds: [0, 42]

--- schema
node Person {
    name: String @key
    value: I64 @index
    text: String @index
    embedding: Vector(4) @index
}

--- seed
{"type":"Person","data":{"name":"p000","value":0,"text":"needle","embedding":[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.0]}}
